}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["2. Build the data (once, needs FinancialData)", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"d7001f37-6e9b-564e-9514-9668db96c852"],

Cell["\<\
The first cell reads the list of tickers. The second one downloads the daily \
prices of every ticker once, makes the daily, weekly and monthly candlesticks \
and saves three files in Data/ (RangePositions_daily.wxf, \
RangePositions_weekly.wxf, RangePositions_monthly.wxf). The files contain, \
for every candlestick, the position of the Open, the position of the Close, \
the relative range and the year, as integers in millionths: no prices. It \
takes about 20 seconds for each ticker, so about 3 hours for the 519 tickers; \
a progress bar is shown. The prices come from FinancialData, whose terms \
apply: that is why the package does not include the data.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7d509e02-851b-7843-9f1d-d8ebd6a45038"],

