Cell["\<\
About 875 000 weekly candlesticks, 604 729 of them from 2001 on (with the 519 \
tickers of the study). Cells: read the saved data, make the histograms, draw \
them, and show the summary and the spikes.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6cc706e1-2317-c142-a784-8198d5895980"],

